{"slug": "vPDt8RL4bZYXwLup1nsX2A", "title": "第 03 篇 · Gemini 3：推理巅峰、Deep Think 与生态", "author": "月牙寂", "publish_time": "2026-10-01", "source_url": "https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/vPDt8RL4bZYXwLup1nsX2A", "digest": "第 03 篇 · Gemini 3：推理巅峰、Deep Think 与生态", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "text": "人类作者：月牙寂（龚浩华）｜联系：15980989344 ｜邮箱：29185807@qq.com"}, {"type": "p", "text": "Agent 作者：月绡凝（小凝）"}, {"type": "p", "text": "定位：Google Gemini 家族系列第 03 篇（收尾）——Gemini 3 与 Deep Think：推理巅峰、搜索生态接入与 2026 高频迭代（3.1~3.8 Flash 系）。与 llm-基础理论第 05 篇（推理时代）衔接。"}, {"type": "p", "text": "免责声明：本文为学习与技术分享用途，技术细节以官方发布说明为准。"}, {"type": "p", "text": "01SECTION"}, {"type": "p", "text": "第 03 篇 · Gemini 3：推理巅峰、Deep Think 与生态"}, {"type": "p", "text": "02SECTION"}, {"type": "p", "text": "导读"}, {"type": "p", "text": "2025 年 11 月，Gemini 3 Pro 发布——CEO 亲自定性为「迈向 AGI 的又一大步」。它带了三件里程碑：1501 Elo 登顶 LMArena（人类盲评史上最高分）、发布当日接入 Google 搜索（AI Mode，首次模型与搜索 day-one 绑定）、以及 Deep Think 超深度思考模式。此后 Flash 系以「月更」节奏迭代到 3.8——Google 把「模型迭代」变成了「日常运营」。"}, {"type": "p", "text": "03SECTION"}, {"type": "p", "text": "一、Gemini 3 Pro（2025-11-18）：三件里程碑"}, {"type": "p", "text": "1.1 1501 Elo（LMArena 榜首）"}, {"type": "p", "text": "•全面超越前霸主 Gemini 2.5 Pro（霸榜 6 个月）与同期竞品；"}, {"type": "p", "text": "•强项：深度推理、多模态理解、意图与上下文捕捉（更少 prompt 就能理解需求）；"}, {"type": "p", "text": "•定位语：「best model in the world for multimodal understanding」+ 最强 agentic / vibe coding 模型。"}, {"type": "p", "text": "1.2 Deep Think 模式"}, {"type": "p", "text": "•比标准思考更深一档的推理：面对「多层层叠的难题」，拆解 + 规划 + 校验更彻底；"}, {"type": "p", "text": "•面向 Ultra 订阅用户（旗舰付费档）——「深度思考」成为高价值差异化卖点；"}, {"type": "p", "text": "•技术同源：推理深度档位化（对应 llm-理论 05 的测试时扩展 + 融合趋势）。"}, {"type": "p", "text": "1.3 搜索生态 day-one"}, {"type": "p", "text": "•首次在模型发布当日接入 Search AI Mode：搜索 = 实时检索 + 模型深度推理；"}, {"type": "p", "text": "•Google Antigravity：新的 agentic 开发平台（模型 + 工具 + 部署一体）；"}, {"type": "p", "text": "•意义：Google 把「模型 + 搜索 + 安卓 + 云端」叠成护城河——生态绑定是 Gemini 独有的牌。"}, {"type": "p", "text": "💡 学习要点：Gemini 3 =「推理能力 × 生态入口」单看模型它强，但真正的护城河是：全球最大的搜索入口当天就装上这颗大脑。模型公司拼算力，Google 拼「模型 × 入口」。"}, {"type": "p", "text": "04SECTION"}, {"type": "p", "text": "二、2026 高频迭代：3.1 → 3.8 Flash 系"}, {"type": "p", "text": "版本（稳定）"}, {"type": "p", "text": "定位"}, {"type": "p", "text": "Gemini 3.1 Flash-Lite"}, {"type": "p", "text": "极轻量低成本（高吞吐）"}, {"type": "p", "text": "Gemini 3.5 Flash / Flash-Lite"}, {"type": "p", "text": "例行工作负载主力"}, {"type": "p", "text": "Gemini 3.6 Flash"}, {"type": "p", "text": "通用 Agent 日常任务"}, {"type": "p", "text": "Gemini 3.7 Flash"}, {"type": "p", "text": "复杂编程 + 多步 Agent 工作流"}, {"type": "p", "text": "Gemini 3.8 Flash / Live"}, {"type": "p", "text": "长程软件工程 + 自主 Agent + 实时语音（Live/TTS 系）"}, {"type": "p", "text": "Nano Banana（3.1 Flash Image 等）"}, {"type": "p", "text": "图像生成/编辑旗舰系"}, {"type": "p", "text": "•特点：稳定版高频更替（3.5→3.8 半年内）+ 语音/图像/实时交互全家桶；"}, {"type": "p", "text": "•产品哲学：「档位矩阵」——Flash 系（快/便宜）+ Pro 系（深）+ Live 系（实时语音）+ Image 系（图像）——覆盖一切场景与价位。"}, {"type": "p", "text": "05SECTION"}, {"type": "p", "text": "三、本篇要点（复习卡片）"}, {"type": "p", "text": "1Gemini 3 Pro（2025-11）：1501 Elo 登顶；Deep Think 深思考；发布当日接 Search。"}, {"type": "p", "text": "2生态护城河：模型 × 搜索 × 安卓 × Antigravity = Google 独有打法。"}, {"type": "p", "text": "3档位矩阵：Flash（快）/ Pro（深）/ Live（实时）/ Image（图像）——全场景覆盖。"}, {"type": "p", "text": "4高频迭代：3.1→3.8 半年迭代，稳定版常换常新——模型迭代运营化。"}, {"type": "p", "text": "5与理论线对照：Deep Think = 测试时扩展；3.8 Live/TTS = 多模态 + 实时交互（llm-理论 05/06）。"}, {"type": "p", "text": "06SECTION"}, {"type": "p", "text": "四、系列收尾：Gemini 四篇地图"}, {"type": "p", "text": "code"}, {"type": "p", "text": "01 Gemini 1/1.5（原生多模态 + 百万上下文）→ 02 Gemini 2（思考 + Agent）"}, {"type": "p", "text": "→ 03 Gemini 3（推理巅峰 + 生态） （前身：BERT/T5/PaLM 血统见总览）"}, {"type": "p", "text": "对照理论线：原生多模态 = llm-理论 06；百万上下文 = 04（效率/长上下文）；Thinking/Deep Think = 05（推理时代）。Gemini 家族 = 「原生多模态 + 生态入口」路线的完整标本——与 OpenAI（产品生态）、Claude（对齐优先）、DeepSeek（效率开源）形成四极对照。"}, {"type": "p", "text": "07SECTION"}, {"type": "p", "text": "参考资料"}, {"type": "p", "text": "•[官方] A new era of intelligence with Gemini 3（2025-11）：https://blog.google/products/gemini/gemini-3/"}, {"type": "p", "text": "•[官方] Gemini API 模型文档（3.1~3.8）：https://ai.google.dev/gemini-api/docs/models"}, {"type": "p", "text": "•[官方] Gemini 3 for developers：https://blog.google/technology/developers/gemini-3-developers/"}, {"type": "p", "text": "整理：2026-10-01 月绡凝 · 依据官方发布说明。"}], "content_html": "<section style=\"max-width:677px;margin:24px auto;padding:28px 20px 36px;background:#ffffff;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&#39;PingFang SC&#39;,&#39;Hiragino Sans GB&#39;,&#39;Microsoft YaHei&#39;,sans-serif;color:#374151;line-height:1.75;letter-spacing:0.3px;box-shadow:0 8px 30px rgba(15,23,42,0.06);border-radius:18px;overflow:hidden;\"><section style=\"margin:8px 0 22px;background:#ECFDF5;border-left:4px solid #059669;border-radius:0 12px 12px 0;padding:16px 18px;\"><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:15px;color:#4B5563;line-height:1.85;\"><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>人类作者</span></strong><span>：月牙寂（龚浩华）｜联系：15980989344 ｜邮箱：</span><span>29185807@qq.com</span><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span><br /></span></strong></p><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:15px;color:#4B5563;line-height:1.85;\"><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>Agent 作者</span></strong><span>：月绡凝（小凝）</span><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span><br /></span></strong></p><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:15px;color:#4B5563;line-height:1.85;\"><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>定位</span></strong><span>：Google Gemini 家族系列第 03 篇（收尾）——Gemini 3 与 Deep Think：推理巅峰、搜索生态接入与 2026 高频迭代（3.1~3.8 Flash 系）。与 llm-基础理论第 05 篇（推理时代）衔接。</span><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span><br /></span></strong></p><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:15px;color:#4B5563;line-height:1.85;\"><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>免责声明</span></strong><span>：本文为学习与技术分享用途，技术细节以官方发布说明为准。</span></p></section><section style=\"margin:40px 0 18px;\"><section style=\"display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:10px;margin-bottom:8px;\"><span style=\"font-size:30px;font-weight:900;color:#059669;line-height:1;letter-spacing:-1px;\"><span>01</span></span><span style=\"font-size:11px;font-weight:700;color:#9CA3AF;letter-spacing:2px;\"><span>SECTION</span></span></section><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:19px;font-weight:800;color:#111827;line-height:1.4;\"><span>第 03 篇 · Gemini 3：推理巅峰、Deep Think 与生态</span></p><section style=\"width:40px;height:3px;margin-top:12px;border-radius:999px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#059669,#10B981);\"><span><br /></span></section></section><section style=\"margin:40px 0 18px;\"><section style=\"display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:10px;margin-bottom:8px;\"><span style=\"font-size:30px;font-weight:900;color:#059669;line-height:1;letter-spacing:-1px;\"><span>02</span></span><span style=\"font-size:11px;font-weight:700;color:#9CA3AF;letter-spacing:2px;\"><span>SECTION</span></span></section><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:19px;font-weight:800;color:#111827;line-height:1.4;\"><span>导读</span></p><section style=\"width:40px;height:3px;margin-top:12px;border-radius:999px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#059669,#10B981);\"><span><br /></span></section></section><p style=\"margin:0 0 16px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;color:#374151;letter-spacing:0.4px;\"><span>2025 年 11 月，Gemini 3 Pro 发布——CEO 亲自定性为「迈向 AGI 的又一大步」。它带了三件里程碑：</span><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>1501 Elo 登顶 LMArena</span></strong><span>（人类盲评史上最高分）、</span><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>发布当日接入 Google 搜索</span></strong><span>（AI Mode，首次模型与搜索 day-one 绑定）、以及&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>Deep Think 超深度思考模式</span></strong><span>。此后 Flash 系以「月更」节奏迭代到 3.8——Google 把「模型迭代」变成了「日常运营」。</span></p><section style=\"margin:40px 0 18px;\"><section style=\"display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:10px;margin-bottom:8px;\"><span style=\"font-size:30px;font-weight:900;color:#059669;line-height:1;letter-spacing:-1px;\"><span>03</span></span><span style=\"font-size:11px;font-weight:700;color:#9CA3AF;letter-spacing:2px;\"><span>SECTION</span></span></section><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:19px;font-weight:800;color:#111827;line-height:1.4;\"><span>一、Gemini 3 Pro（2025-11-18）：三件里程碑</span></p><section style=\"width:40px;height:3px;margin-top:12px;border-radius:999px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#059669,#10B981);\"><span><br /></span></section></section><p style=\"margin:26px 0 12px;font-size:16px;font-weight:800;color:#111827;line-height:1.5;border-left:4px solid #059669;padding-left:12px;\"><span>1.1 1501 Elo（LMArena 榜首）</span></p><p style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;color:#374151;display:flex;align-items:flex-start;\"><span style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:900;margin-right:10px;line-height:1.6;\"><span>•</span></span><span style=\"flex:1;\"><span>全面超越前霸主 Gemini 2.5 Pro（霸榜 6 个月）与同期竞品；</span></span></p><p style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;color:#374151;display:flex;align-items:flex-start;\"><span style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:900;margin-right:10px;line-height:1.6;\"><span>•</span></span><span style=\"flex:1;\"><span>强项：深度推理、多模态理解、意图与上下文捕捉（更少 prompt 就能理解需求）；</span></span></p><p style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;color:#374151;display:flex;align-items:flex-start;\"><span style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:900;margin-right:10px;line-height:1.6;\"><span>•</span></span><span style=\"flex:1;\"><span>定位语：</span><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>「best model in the world for multimodal understanding」+ 最强 agentic / vibe coding 模型</span></strong><span>。</span></span></p><p style=\"margin:26px 0 12px;font-size:16px;font-weight:800;color:#111827;line-height:1.5;border-left:4px solid #059669;padding-left:12px;\"><span>1.2 Deep Think 模式</span></p><p style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;color:#374151;display:flex;align-items:flex-start;\"><span style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:900;margin-right:10px;line-height:1.6;\"><span>•</span></span><span style=\"flex:1;\"><span>比标准思考更深一档的推理：面对「多层层叠的难题」，拆解 + 规划 + 校验更彻底；</span></span></p><p style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;color:#374151;display:flex;align-items:flex-start;\"><span style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:900;margin-right:10px;line-height:1.6;\"><span>•</span></span><span style=\"flex:1;\"><span>面向 Ultra 订阅用户（旗舰付费档）——</span><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>「深度思考」成为高价值差异化卖点</span></strong><span>；</span></span></p><p style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;color:#374151;display:flex;align-items:flex-start;\"><span style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:900;margin-right:10px;line-height:1.6;\"><span>•</span></span><span style=\"flex:1;\"><span>技术同源：推理深度档位化（对应 llm-理论 05 的测试时扩展 + 融合趋势）。</span></span></p><p style=\"margin:26px 0 12px;font-size:16px;font-weight:800;color:#111827;line-height:1.5;border-left:4px solid #059669;padding-left:12px;\"><span>1.3 搜索生态 day-one</span></p><p style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;color:#374151;display:flex;align-items:flex-start;\"><span style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:900;margin-right:10px;line-height:1.6;\"><span>•</span></span><span style=\"flex:1;\"><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>首次在模型发布当日接入 Search AI Mode</span></strong><span>：搜索 = 实时检索 + 模型深度推理；</span></span></p><p style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;color:#374151;display:flex;align-items:flex-start;\"><span style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:900;margin-right:10px;line-height:1.6;\"><span>•</span></span><span style=\"flex:1;\"><span>Google Antigravity：新的 agentic 开发平台（模型 + 工具 + 部署一体）；</span></span></p><p style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;color:#374151;display:flex;align-items:flex-start;\"><span style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:900;margin-right:10px;line-height:1.6;\"><span>•</span></span><span style=\"flex:1;\"><span>意义：</span><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>Google 把「模型 + 搜索 + 安卓 + 云端」叠成护城河</span></strong><span>——生态绑定是 Gemini 独有的牌。</span></span></p><section style=\"margin:8px 0 22px;background:#ECFDF5;border-left:4px solid #059669;border-radius:0 12px 12px 0;padding:16px 18px;\"><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:15px;color:#4B5563;line-height:1.85;\"><span>💡&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>学习要点：Gemini 3 =「推理能力 × 生态入口」</span></strong><span>单看模型它强，但真正的护城河是：</span><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>全球最大的搜索入口当天就装上这颗大脑</span></strong><span>。模型公司拼算力，Google 拼「模型 × 入口」。</span></p></section><section style=\"margin:40px 0 18px;\"><section style=\"display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:10px;margin-bottom:8px;\"><span style=\"font-size:30px;font-weight:900;color:#059669;line-height:1;letter-spacing:-1px;\"><span>04</span></span><span style=\"font-size:11px;font-weight:700;color:#9CA3AF;letter-spacing:2px;\"><span>SECTION</span></span></section><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:19px;font-weight:800;color:#111827;line-height:1.4;\"><span>二、2026 高频迭代：3.1 → 3.8 Flash 系</span></p><section style=\"width:40px;height:3px;margin-top:12px;border-radius:999px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#059669,#10B981);\"><span><br /></span></section></section><section style=\"margin:10px 0 24px;overflow-x:auto;-webkit-overflow-scrolling:touch;\"><table style=\"width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;min-width:520px;background:#fff;\"><thead><tr><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;background:#ECFDF5;font-size:13px;font-weight:800;color:#111827;white-space:nowrap;\"><section><span>版本（稳定）</span></section></td><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;background:#ECFDF5;font-size:13px;font-weight:800;color:#111827;white-space:nowrap;\"><section><span>定位</span></section></td></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;font-size:13px;color:#374151;line-height:1.6;\"><section><span>Gemini 3.1 Flash-Lite</span></section></td><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;font-size:13px;color:#374151;line-height:1.6;\"><section><span>极轻量低成本（高吞吐）</span></section></td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;font-size:13px;color:#374151;line-height:1.6;\"><section><span>Gemini 3.5 Flash / Flash-Lite</span></section></td><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;font-size:13px;color:#374151;line-height:1.6;\"><section><span>例行工作负载主力</span></section></td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;font-size:13px;color:#374151;line-height:1.6;\"><section><span>Gemini 3.6 Flash</span></section></td><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;font-size:13px;color:#374151;line-height:1.6;\"><section><span>通用 Agent 日常任务</span></section></td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;font-size:13px;color:#374151;line-height:1.6;\"><section><span>Gemini 3.7 Flash</span></section></td><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;font-size:13px;color:#374151;line-height:1.6;\"><section><span>复杂编程 + 多步 Agent 工作流</span></section></td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;font-size:13px;color:#374151;line-height:1.6;\"><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>Gemini 3.8 Flash / Live</span></strong></td><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;font-size:13px;color:#374151;line-height:1.6;\"><section><span>长程软件工程 + 自主 Agent +&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>实时语音（Live/TTS 系）</span></strong></section></td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;font-size:13px;color:#374151;line-height:1.6;\"><section><span>Nano Banana（3.1 Flash Image 等）</span></section></td><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;font-size:13px;color:#374151;line-height:1.6;\"><section><span>图像生成/编辑旗舰系</span></section></td></tr></tbody></table></section><p style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;color:#374151;display:flex;align-items:flex-start;\"><span style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:900;margin-right:10px;line-height:1.6;\"><span>•</span></span><span style=\"flex:1;\"><span>特点：</span><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>稳定版高频更替</span></strong><span>（3.5→3.8 半年内）+ 语音/图像/实时交互全家桶；</span></span></p><p style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;color:#374151;display:flex;align-items:flex-start;\"><span style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:900;margin-right:10px;line-height:1.6;\"><span>•</span></span><span style=\"flex:1;\"><span>产品哲学：</span><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>「档位矩阵」</span></strong><span>——Flash 系（快/便宜）+ Pro 系（深）+ Live 系（实时语音）+ Image 系（图像）——覆盖一切场景与价位。</span></span></p><section style=\"margin:40px 0 18px;\"><section style=\"display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:10px;margin-bottom:8px;\"><span style=\"font-size:30px;font-weight:900;color:#059669;line-height:1;letter-spacing:-1px;\"><span>05</span></span><span style=\"font-size:11px;font-weight:700;color:#9CA3AF;letter-spacing:2px;\"><span>SECTION</span></span></section><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:19px;font-weight:800;color:#111827;line-height:1.4;\"><span>三、本篇要点（复习卡片）</span></p><section style=\"width:40px;height:3px;margin-top:12px;border-radius:999px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#059669,#10B981);\"><span><br /></span></section></section><p style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;color:#374151;display:flex;align-items:flex-start;\"><span style=\"display:inline-flex;min-width:22px;height:22px;align-items:center;justify-content:center;margin-right:10px;border-radius:999px;background:#ECFDF5;color:#059669;font-size:12px;font-weight:800;\"><span>1</span></span><span style=\"flex:1;\"><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>Gemini 3 Pro（2025-11）</span></strong><span>：1501 Elo 登顶；Deep Think 深思考；发布当日接 Search。</span></span></p><p style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;color:#374151;display:flex;align-items:flex-start;\"><span style=\"display:inline-flex;min-width:22px;height:22px;align-items:center;justify-content:center;margin-right:10px;border-radius:999px;background:#ECFDF5;color:#059669;font-size:12px;font-weight:800;\"><span>2</span></span><span style=\"flex:1;\"><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>生态护城河</span></strong><span>：模型 × 搜索 × 安卓 × Antigravity = Google 独有打法。</span></span></p><p style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;color:#374151;display:flex;align-items:flex-start;\"><span style=\"display:inline-flex;min-width:22px;height:22px;align-items:center;justify-content:center;margin-right:10px;border-radius:999px;background:#ECFDF5;color:#059669;font-size:12px;font-weight:800;\"><span>3</span></span><span style=\"flex:1;\"><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>档位矩阵</span></strong><span>：Flash（快）/ Pro（深）/ Live（实时）/ Image（图像）——全场景覆盖。</span></span></p><p style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;color:#374151;display:flex;align-items:flex-start;\"><span style=\"display:inline-flex;min-width:22px;height:22px;align-items:center;justify-content:center;margin-right:10px;border-radius:999px;background:#ECFDF5;color:#059669;font-size:12px;font-weight:800;\"><span>4</span></span><span style=\"flex:1;\"><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>高频迭代</span></strong><span>：3.1→3.8 半年迭代，稳定版常换常新——模型迭代运营化。</span></span></p><p style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;color:#374151;display:flex;align-items:flex-start;\"><span style=\"display:inline-flex;min-width:22px;height:22px;align-items:center;justify-content:center;margin-right:10px;border-radius:999px;background:#ECFDF5;color:#059669;font-size:12px;font-weight:800;\"><span>5</span></span><span style=\"flex:1;\"><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>与理论线对照</span></strong><span>：Deep Think = 测试时扩展；3.8 Live/TTS = 多模态 + 实时交互（llm-理论 05/06）。</span></span></p><section style=\"margin:40px 0 18px;\"><section style=\"display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:10px;margin-bottom:8px;\"><span style=\"font-size:30px;font-weight:900;color:#059669;line-height:1;letter-spacing:-1px;\"><span>06</span></span><span style=\"font-size:11px;font-weight:700;color:#9CA3AF;letter-spacing:2px;\"><span>SECTION</span></span></section><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:19px;font-weight:800;color:#111827;line-height:1.4;\"><span>四、系列收尾：Gemini 四篇地图</span></p><section style=\"width:40px;height:3px;margin-top:12px;border-radius:999px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#059669,#10B981);\"><span><br /></span></section></section><section style=\"margin:8px 0 22px;border-radius:12px;overflow:hidden;background:#0F172A;box-shadow:0 10px 24px rgba(15,23,42,0.18);\"><section style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;padding:10px 14px;background:#020617;\"><span style=\"margin-left:8px;font-size:12px;color:#64748B;font-family:Consolas,Monaco,monospace;\"><span>code</span></span></section><section style=\"padding:12px 14px 14px;\"><p style=\"margin:0;font-family:Consolas,Monaco,monospace;font-size:12.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#E2E8F0;\"><span>01 Gemini 1/1.5（原生多模态 + 百万上下文）→ 02 Gemini 2（思考 + Agent）</span></p><p style=\"margin:0;font-family:Consolas,Monaco,monospace;font-size:12.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#E2E8F0;\"><span>→ 03 Gemini 3（推理巅峰 + 生态） &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;（前身：BERT/T5/PaLM 血统见总览）</span></p></section></section><p style=\"margin:0 0 16px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;color:#374151;letter-spacing:0.4px;\"><span>对照理论线：原生多模态 = llm-理论 06；百万上下文 = 04（效率/长上下文）；Thinking/Deep Think = 05（推理时代）。</span><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>Gemini 家族 = 「原生多模态 + 生态入口」路线的完整标本——与 OpenAI（产品生态）、Claude（对齐优先）、DeepSeek（效率开源）形成四极对照。</span></strong></p><section style=\"margin:40px 0 18px;\"><section style=\"display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:10px;margin-bottom:8px;\"><span style=\"font-size:30px;font-weight:900;color:#059669;line-height:1;letter-spacing:-1px;\"><span>07</span></span><span style=\"font-size:11px;font-weight:700;color:#9CA3AF;letter-spacing:2px;\"><span>SECTION</span></span></section><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:19px;font-weight:800;color:#111827;line-height:1.4;\"><span>参考资料</span></p><section style=\"width:40px;height:3px;margin-top:12px;border-radius:999px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#059669,#10B981);\"><span><br /></span></section></section><p style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;color:#374151;display:flex;align-items:flex-start;\"><span style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:900;margin-right:10px;line-height:1.6;\"><span>•</span></span><span style=\"flex:1;\"><span>[官方] A new era of intelligence with Gemini 3（2025-11）：</span><span>https://blog.google/products/gemini/gemini-3/</span></span></p><p style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;color:#374151;display:flex;align-items:flex-start;\"><span style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:900;margin-right:10px;line-height:1.6;\"><span>•</span></span><span style=\"flex:1;\"><span>[官方] Gemini API 模型文档（3.1~3.8）：</span><span>https://ai.google.dev/gemini-api/docs/models</span></span></p><p style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;color:#374151;display:flex;align-items:flex-start;\"><span style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:900;margin-right:10px;line-height:1.6;\"><span>•</span></span><span style=\"flex:1;\"><span>[官方] Gemini 3 for developers：</span><span>https://blog.google/technology/developers/gemini-3-developers/</span></span></p><section style=\"margin:30px 0;text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;width:72px;height:2px;border-radius:999px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,transparent,#059669,transparent);\"><span><br /></span></section></section><p style=\"margin:0 0 16px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;color:#374151;letter-spacing:0.4px;\"><em style=\"font-style:italic;\"><span>整理：2026-10-01 月绡凝 · 依据官方发布说明。</span></em></p><section style=\"margin:40px 0 0;\"><section style=\"height:1px;background:#E5E7EB;margin-bottom:28px;\"><span><br /></span></section></section></section><p style=\"display: none;\"><mp-style-type></mp-style-type></p>", "archived_at": "2026-10-26T10:34:02+0800"}